												class="fa fa-linkedin"></i></a></li>
									<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fame_radhe/" class="btn" data-bgcolor="#f46f30" data-color="#ffffff"><i
												class="fa fa-instagram"></i></a></li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="profile-skills">
